      "ae.patchBadge1": "🧊 Global Update",
      "ae.patchFooterNote": "The pack ships with shaders turned off — you enable them manually so the first launch does not kill a weak machine. In a clean scene with shaders at 32 chunks it runs around 130–150 FPS. Water scenes cost roughly twice as much on any tier: that is the shader pack’s reflection architecture, not a bug.",
